{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a91018fda61fd58a8010aaea7c027eb6dbaa6181d6d8ad1f72522d33e05c2138",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af5106c0bf39a56facddd58d08ff99122ac717dc421f58c673ae51577c9e049",
      "text": "对主角绝对要保密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0c8aee07825c442f2f8f63765a7ffd5212eba374eb0532696c70fccdb70cc87",
      "text": "马上就要迎来生日的志狼。\n坚信肯定有人在为自己筹划生日会的他，\n悄悄打探直央等人的动向，却完全没有任何痕迹。\n面对一如既往毫无异样的大家，志狼垂头丧气，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af5106c0bf39a56facddd58d08ff99122ac717dc421f58c673ae51577c9e049",
      "text": "对主角绝对要保密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6fa4f75363506997382926f61df6c771b2d9ef2cccdc63ab53512a1720769b5",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人！\n4月22号那天，有什么安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc6e5ca1bd38170831bed634aa81f98fb998ecb615bc38791a9bb3f4d5117cfd",
      "text": "呃……是的。那天正如前几天通知的那样，\n有もふもふえん的舞蹈练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce1f6e6b9d5cf42c80e8d7bbff93b7e357a8fbc1350bef0eed7d748e55f752a1",
      "text": "那件事我知道啦！不是指那个啦——\n我是问那之后还有没有别的安排！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33c444f228b6e1c94af312ff4642f36ba681421d40d2fc7bea2701faa418c663",
      "text": "没有，特别的安排倒是……舞蹈练习结束后，\n大家就是自由时间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a909440ede65070ebcd8720583d1e0dcc305620a1470c7a7e0f63398f1c06afa",
      "text": "所以说，那个我也知道啦！\n不是指那个——呃，就是说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96930d1cf9218a5d4366ea2bfce48dbf97ed8009e96ec05715d3f75e542e8292",
      "text": "（花、花音和直央的话，肯定懂我想说什么的吧……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54bbdff3d3399cc6d5017160ab248d668220d040aa2dd807ea4cd50e95fef010",
      "text": "……呜呜，今天的作业好难哦～。\n直央君，这个你会吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f174117b7233cb0dc614c5094c23169c601df02454f66cfeab41c43ab6b169ba",
      "text": "给我看看。\n啊，这个在课本的这里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e03d19cac61f0d364adc50959fd160ef02249d7f05fc9377d41b72843dfd7eb1",
      "text": "（完全没在听我说话嘛！\n唔、唔唔……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef17f089133f71b1d53adc91d151d775637ebccef20a44e173af9618c73eb1f3",
      "text": "（……！对啦，想到了个好主意）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:858f74a714447dfcd985af73f3dca4816599fadfbcfbe392cd1949a157a54290",
      "text": "我突然想去趟便利店了～。\n哎呀，想吃点零食嘛～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:352c853700df4b6934be9646b9a2dc2a4c3b0f461e20e34976e070e5ab08c23b",
      "text": "吃什么好呢，超纠结的～！\n回来可能会花点时间哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706376129b1d31a86b26d0c9a369d2a638b0c149278dda2e0d25798065b68805",
      "text": "那么，就是这样啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:651b81fa4228d97dcab2fdf14bca0c7919a17e966c4676e301eb817835bc3511",
      "text": "（才怪呢！\n趁我不在，你们终于要聊那个话题了吧？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9bda1e098c45fba860e3840d9ad31028c2da87b728dc78f409dc7043a9301cf",
      "text": "（不管是花音的生日还是直央的生日，大家都是\n为了不暴露而悄悄准备的嘛……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d791b635fa6a50d98a1b0a8b129a51fd29d1556488c4333f495aeba0ed4b8682",
      "text": "（我的生日肯定也会这么干的！\n嘿嘿，自以为很保密，可惜落空啦）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1485f0da60225e2c38ddf36e8f3c976a34a055e62589d1ebdbd9c99197a1e044",
      "text": "（志狼大人我可是道高一尺魔高一丈。\n你们的计划，我就好好听个够吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0603476e2373a8d4d00d1e90f6019153869d27d91c01e043bb21b56381291964",
      "text": "那个，制作人。\n算术的这道题有点难……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31f9f0962f0c6239fb96b7af5a61dbefae79b9911f873f470b153ad3a5a6632",
      "text": "呐呐，能给一点点提示吗♪\n花音感觉就差一点点就能解出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:722c5a0274048edff42f0d670b3cf09e020413d9c021ba626f11e7f0c3ce3640",
      "text": "你们两个认真写作业真了不起呢。\n这道题是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fba174c207a10ac1a0d2f311d52e89e0a6793d05e89715257b8cb7dfa68817d",
      "text": "什……！？居然还在正常写作业啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a062759438736202c034c742b3a57b84c50114bd0714a4493337cf0f78a148e",
      "text": "搞什么嘛，这群家伙……\n真无聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cde56b263e0b5505190bdf300f357d22d316eea25427627122b6096e815b9c31",
      "text": "……志狼君，走了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23f38bcb9311068eecb05378e0814d9a060cf233ae50f2ca2b892c4d99e5afb3",
      "text": "嗯……好像已经走了。\n志狼君演得好假哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42800ecce400506341b520b9909ec6b7f2570d41433d17a5a32e016677ddc513",
      "text": "呵呵，我也懂志狼君的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf8adbcea749e93df4bb80ebcb7602acd90a82182996c818ea869b30e5e966fd",
      "text": "因为花音君的生日会是瞒着准备的，\n轮到我的时候也是心里坐立不安的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f361bfe8c5bff4c1bab7b99b08eb1dd08cb9f0bdc08943e3e3f0113a8e45ccb",
      "text": "花音也是呢，一直在意大家会不会\n给我办生日会呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c3a2dacb6dd1c709b242553a36bab9fc8ff571eeffb19c75ed9508e6e1df61f",
      "text": "惊喜派对虽然吓了一跳，\n但相对地也超级开心。诶嘿嘿♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1baa4084b0411d0ba7ddd480e796f826a793e431fddeae21973ab3d4f058ea7c",
      "text": "所以，为了让志狼君也能高兴，\n绝对——要保密哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf96e526cb95f90c7d63daf031d65669c4aa6c459cac323c01b04c11a22fe539",
      "text": "直央君和制作人也会帮忙的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5133c7976c9ab137920da9b36d260863a02a201cdb33c59a25ccfdc0196a705a",
      "text": "当然。\n大家一起吓志狼君一跳吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47a8518a051d644af3f5dbf9b05556f679d38c84e41571908889e590535878a8",
      "text": "好的。我也会全力提供协助的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed3fad4069cd300e6cdaef552673c55eb25217e21adc3c1286b12dea3288f5e9",
      "text": "（虽然直到今天探听了各种情况，\n但花音、直央和制作人都和平常一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21fa4030054a631ae63e70c2c59560f72688bff0eb3e3b6d9aa35c28c4ecc186",
      "text": "（看起来也不像是在准备什么……\n难道我的生日会真的没有吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3dea10a2da6d4a421257488a8017512180fd3b8b78d893b955bd997051f25e",
      "text": "……咦、奇怪！？刚才的动作跳错了吗？\n抱歉两位，再让我跳一次……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000087:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4896e36dfcb04dbbcf6573ceb9da2b3bccc3e93b4d92267b5451e59ecc805879",
      "text": "舞蹈练习结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb5264ca0fff52b71b57009ea7e63153dbfa04d7aa4a8f62adda128bf28bdbf0",
      "text": "（哈啊……\n真逊啊，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f32afe75c35628d1e277232447ee9d46671e823ec2243adb835863c95e805735",
      "text": "志狼君。自主练习虽好，\n不过差不多该收工了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33dfe03aab8bb84d9ad369bd416eb3c39d91e3874a6dec8315d46959e966c352",
      "text": "志狼君。今天的舞蹈练习怎么啦？\n明明直到昨天都还超级有干劲的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:091b614fd2e81091e87f0f6db6453f74ab900854a36bc4f02a9d6c48acbe74ee",
      "text": "难道是哪里身体不舒服吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6c9c99c5e01c48197445beb72576a01a6254d2fb21a991c3e883ed0bf5761c7",
      "text": "没……\n并没有啦，我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70ba71c5a09c202e37c7b39d7570bc7cb7e834f2ccbaa8ffe433ec3c8222649",
      "text": "怎么办……虽然原本打算接下来给志狼君\n办生日会的，要改天吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22a0fca70be858754f108df639751fb49d9409890f7177eb6c72028d3dfaaedc",
      "text": "……诶！？\n果然还是有的嘛，我的生日会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7051346a58028ee7cab68636ce6e160c36bc98b8ba396cdc55f1de7e8d637b9a",
      "text": "好耶，是派对是派对！\n超有精神了，嘿嘿！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57ee7223d1bf85618cec6c9e275d8f4d2c2310f8175f16eb9fcec3692fe99d53",
      "text": "哇，突然变得好有活力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010ee31e3d6139c6e3d122dc955e61144343ab57fcccdfd3d072f37ba58b526e",
      "text": "太好了。那我们去派对会场吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beceb564c01aca79da3c4a4651b34bec79a42060dfd6b6e107e6234e1852027e",
      "text": "啊，等一下！\n能让我从头到尾再完整跳一遍吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ef1163af4d851efc1de1d9ea2ddff9343fb4dae7de56d461b3d6a30b588b52a",
      "text": "现在的我，感觉能跳出最棒的舞步！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f36f2442e044cbf9265a867724a2407f6490f29f412e4fceafb30fd7c3969e1d",
      "text": "非常完美，志狼君。\n那么，我们回事务所吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000110:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8ba5f63568d1a2ab1f0cbe6fd89097aadb0c318b65cba044ff7567676625767",
      "text": "之后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3905689d617c31cd6f7df41099e85ec777a4d2570d9ed02d95f594da2ebec7fb",
      "text": "祝你生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab3a1a13b073bb2c0890c4e58bbec01d35806871fe77d3d2d70a48b965dd3660",
      "text": "谢啦！\n我还真以为啥都没有呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:759145d4a90caab33e8e8f640505e646f20c903c798b55e3c6e2b037d722a429",
      "text": "肯定会办的呀～♪\n因为，明明好好约定过了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e336458962a7c8fcb90fbeb1dda06d7dc215590dcc0c457ab409fce243ddb750",
      "text": "让你担心了对不起，志狼君。\n难道今天一直不在状态也是因为……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2585324eb60bfe7105d4931b7b7b19d48bd8114b7bd41a4f5be05e12e255a23",
      "text": "才没担心呢！\n不在状态也只是碰巧而已啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a52c25cacf2934836b020646ef7434032d7d36e7c8ea222c39f053fe7231099",
      "text": "呵呵，那就好。\n我们准备的惊喜，有让你开心吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9312eb5647e233af0b84606b6fa4e5e118539495d62bb5246a666caae83c7ee1",
      "text": "嗯！不仅有蛋糕、我最喜欢的美食，\n还有大家送的礼物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_e:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c4184396de3649485f4fb22019ec75b4293032fd579addfc1b98b9ad1905cd",
      "text": "全都让我大吃一惊，而且全都超级开心！\n花音、直央、制作人，谢谢你们啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
